# SwitchBlockEffect.java, General Jarkeld's branch: human attacks with
# Grizzly Bears (2/2) and Craw Wurm (6/4). ai blocks the Bears with Hill
# Giant (3/3) and the Wurm with Mons's Goblin Raiders (1/1). In the declare
# blockers step (Jarkeld's ActivationPhases$) human taps Jarkeld targeting
# both attackers: each blocker now blocks the other attacker. Combat damage
# then kills both blockers -- the Wurm kills the Giant, the Bears kill the
# Raiders -- instead of the Giant killing the Bears.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1,2
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 4=1,5=2
declareblockers
queue action human activate 3 0
queue targets 1,2
passpriority
advance
advance
combatdamage
# One more advance for the state-based-action check that moves the
# lethally damaged creatures to the graveyard.
advance
